{"id":23036,"name":"将光阴织成黄金","rarity":5,"path":"Memory","desc":"记忆命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「这一缕，是战士的牺牲。」</i>\\n<i>「这一缕，是英雄的成长。」</i>\\n<i>「这一缕，是城邦的繁盛。」</i>\\n……\\n衣匠牵丝引线，汇聚在她的指尖。\\n<i>「一些英雄的轨迹，已然断裂……」</i>\\n她挽起另一些金丝，接续缝补。\\n<i>「一些英雄的命运，仍要向前延展……」</i>\\n\\n被赋予神性的织机兀自运转，衣匠们曼舞翩跹。千年时光在织机上流过，她早已习惯了如此的等待——\\n\\n为了那将光阴织成黄金的「灵感」。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23036,"name":"创设","desc":"使装备者的基础速度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]</unbreak></color>，装备者和装备者的忆灵在攻击后使装备者获得1层【织锦】，每层【织锦】使装备者和装备者的忆灵暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[f1]%</unbreak></color>，最多叠加<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>层。叠加至上限时，每层【织锦】额外使造成的普攻伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[f1]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[12,6,0.09,0.09]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[14,6,0.105,0.105]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[16,6,0.12,0.12]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[18,6,0.135,0.135]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[20,6,0.15,0.15]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110251,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110253,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":115003,"